Mon Sep 28 08:00:46 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2.2.0:
  * Security: fix arbitrary local file read through
    `.. literalinclude::` accepting absolute and `../` paths
    (GHSA-qf6c-j2qx-p22r).
  * Security: fix arbitrary local file read through `.. raw::`
    with `:file:` or `:url:`; same fix covers `.. csv-table::`
    and the `include` directive (GHSA-qx2q-xxw7-587f).
  * Directives reading other files are now disabled by default;
    pass `allow_file_access=True` (`--allow-file-access` on
    the CLI) to enable them for trusted markup.
  * Add `parsed-literal` support, sidebar subtitles, better
    docinfo rendering and Python domain type/value titles.
  * Many rendering fixes: admonition panels, stray blank lines,
    headers, footers, math labels and the man page section.
  * No runtime dependency changes.

